WEBVTT

00:14:57.076 --> 00:15:01.196
but it's also the magical belief
that if I have insurance,

00:15:01.236 --> 00:15:03.276
it's not going to rain.

00:15:03.716 --> 00:15:06.876
The damage is not going to happen,

00:15:06.876 --> 00:15:11.316
and magical thinking
is not susceptible to deductibles.

00:15:14.636 --> 00:15:16.516
What are the lessons to be learned?

00:15:17.156 --> 00:15:19.756
For us, for you?

00:15:19.796 --> 00:15:22.556
Next time you consider buying insurance,

00:15:22.556 --> 00:15:24.396
remember Kafka.

00:15:25.116 --> 00:15:27.196
Ask yourself:

00:15:27.236 --> 00:15:30.916
Am I buying insurance
for the right reasons?